+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Per-domain rate limit
+
+The exact rate limit encountered while fetching this corpus could not be
+recovered from the repository. In particular, the checked-in records do not
+state:
+
+- how many visits were allowed per window;
+- the length of that window; or
+- the cooldown imposed after a breach.
+
+`GATE1.md` records only that fetching was rate-limited and proceeded
+incrementally. No numeric values are recorded, so none are inferred here.
+
+## Fetch hosts
+
+The manifest records `raw.githubusercontent.com` as the host used to fetch the
+files (`manifest.tsv`, line 1).
+
+No other CDN or mirror host used for the corpus fetch could be found in the
+checked-in corpus metadata or repository history.
